cargo-zempic 0.0.1
    workspace: [WORKSPACE_ROOT]  (1 members, 1 selected)
      profile: release  (inherits: none)
optimizing for: size
       target: aarch64-apple-darwin

TIER 1  FOUNDATIONAL                                                   1 finding

  HIGH   none   workspace/ignored-member-profile member/Cargo.toml
        effort: trivial   runtime cost: none   fix: safe
        Cargo honors a `[profile.*]` table only in the workspace root manifest,
        so this member's table has no effect. Moving the settings to the root
        makes them take effect.
        Tradeoff: The table is silently inert, so removing it changes nothing about the
        artifact.
SUMMARY
  1 finding: 1 high.  By magnitude: 1 none.
  1 auto-fixable.

  Magnitude is an ordinal judgement, not a measurement. zempic does not build
  and does not read compiled artifacts, so it reports no sizes.
